# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# The Sentry embeds these vDSO images with go:embed. The build fails without them.
!/pkg/sentry/loader/vdsodata/*.so

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
!coverage.go
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/
/upstream/
/.upstream/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum
!/ext/go.work

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
/rungvx
/rungvx.exe

# Renderer bundle and caches of scripts/gpu/build-renderer.sh
/build/
__pycache__/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
